  "bodyHash": "79fb99ae94c02114",
  "content": "\n\n<h3>FTB Ultimine <em>(For Forge)</em></h3>\n<p>FTB Ultimine 提供有效的模式，可以一次採集多個方塊。只需在 Minecraft 控制畫面中按住設定的按鍵即可啟動模組，收集的物品會在你的腳下自動收集，這樣你就不需要四處走動！在 1.15 及更高版本中，該模組會在小塊周圍渲染白色線條來增強可視性，不僅提供明確的採集範圍指示，看起來也很酷！</p>\n<p>在我們的文件網站上閱讀有關 FTB Ultimine 的更多資訊 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdocs-ultimine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/docs-ultimine</a></p>\n<h4><strong>支援與需求</strong></h4>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/supports-forge@smallest.webp?v=1\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/supports-neoforge@smallest.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/requires-arch@smallest.webp?v=1\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h4><strong>搭配模組</strong></h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-chunks-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/pairs-with-chunks@smallest.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-essentials-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/pairs-with-essentials@smallest.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h4><strong>主要功能</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>高效方塊採集</strong>：按住可配置的波浪號鍵即可同時採集多個方塊，簡化你的採礦流程。</li>\n<li><strong>增強視覺效果 (1.15+)</strong>：體驗改進的視覺提示，被標記為採集或鋤草的方塊周圍會顯示白色線條，讓你知道自己在做什麼。不再會出錯！</li>\n<li><strong>鋤頭用於草地</strong>：將功能擴展到農業，使用鋤頭對草地進行類似操作，一次鋤多個方塊，節省你的時間和精力。</li>\n<li><strong>作物採集</strong>：透過右鍵點擊來簡化作物採集，提供一種輕鬆收集資源的便捷方式。</li>\n<li><strong>草地的特殊處理</strong>：利用草地獨特的處理方式，有效管理超出標準 1 格範圍的草狀方塊。</li>\n<li><strong>採礦助手</strong>：使用 Ultimine，你可以輕鬆挖掘隧道，無論是上下階梯，還是前往你的下一個礦坑！</li>\n</ul>\n<p>FTB Ultimine 旨在優化你的採礦和農業活動，提供流暢且高效的遊戲體驗。它包含在我們的許多包以及其他包中！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-ultimine/OCYVCUi.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-ultimine/OY1v6uo.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>你也可以使用鋤頭對草地進行類似操作，一次鋤多個方塊：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-ultimine/rB22fHN.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>並透過右鍵點擊來採集作物：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-ultimine/vMBREKF.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>草地有特殊處理，會尋找 1 格範圍之外的方塊：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-ultimine/w3Pad8m.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>支援</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>如有 <strong>整合包</strong> 問題，請前往此處： <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-modpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-modpack</a></li>\n<li>如有 <strong>模組</strong> 問題，請前往此處： <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-mod-issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-mod-issues</a></li>\n<li>有問題嗎？歡迎來我們的 Discord： <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/discord</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>保持關注</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-discord.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fgithub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-github.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitter-x.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fyoutube\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-youtube.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitch.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252finstagram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-instagram.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ffacebook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-facebook.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftiktok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-tiktok.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
